{"sourceUrl":"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/2025/0703/c9297a574880/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:25.395135+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/2025/0703/c9297a574880/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><a href=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/2025/0703/c9297a574880/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><strong>南开大学材料科学与工程学院关于举办</strong></span><span><strong>2025</strong></span><span><strong>年优秀大学生</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>夏令营报名通知</strong></span></p><p><span>为增进高校间优秀大学生的交流与联系，促进优秀本科生对南开大学材料学科的了解与体验，我院将于</span><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>14</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>-16</span><span>日举办“南开大学材料科学与工程学院</span></span><span><span>2025</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营”。</span></span></p><p><span>学院所有专业均接受报名，营员可根据兴趣和发展方向选择研究方向，欢迎全国各高校优秀学子踊跃报名</span><span>!</span></p><p><span>各专业方向包括：</span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>直博：</span></span><span><span>080501</span><span>材料物理与化学（学术学位）、</span></span><span><span>080502</span><span>材料学（学术学位）、</span></span><span><span>085601</span><span>材料工程（专业学位）</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>学硕：</span></span><span><span>080501</span><span>材料物理与化学、</span></span><span><span>080502</span><span>材料学</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>专硕：</span></span><span><span>085601</span><span>材料工程</span></span></p><p><span><strong>一、报名条件</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>热爱祖国、遵纪守法、诚实守信、品德良好、身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.2026</span><span>年应届本科毕业生，本科期间学习成绩优秀；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>对材料、化学、物理等相关学科的科研工作抱有浓厚兴趣，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业发展潜力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><span>英语成绩须符合以下任一项：</span></span></p><p><span><span>(1)</span><span>通过全国大学英语六级考试，成绩</span></span><span><span>425</span><span>分及以上，或通过全国大学英语四级考试且成绩为优秀（</span></span><span><span>550</span><span>分及以上）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(2)TOEFL</span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>90</span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(3)IELTS(A</span><span>类</span></span><span><span>/</span><span>学术类</span></span><span><span>)</span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>6</span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(4)GRE</span><span>成绩在</span></span><span><span>310</span><span>分及以上，</span></span><span><span>GMAT</span><span>成绩在</span></span><span><span>640</span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(5)</span><span>英语专业四级</span></span><span><span>(</span><span>及以上</span></span><span><span>)</span><span>考试合格。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>二、报名方式及流程</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>网上报名</span></span></p><p><span>扫描下方二维码打开报名链接：</span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/71/69/2c2acbcd4739ab8c9d9638252ca4/6ceaed80-42dd-4043-a90c-60b60216b3d7.png\"/></p><p><span>请成功入营的同学将以下材料电子版发送至邮箱</span><span><span>mater@nankai.edu.cn</span><span>：</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span><span>）本科成绩单和专业排名证明（需加盖学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span><span>）国家英语四级、六级考试成绩单复印件或</span></span><span><span>TOEFL/GRE/</span><span>雅思成绩等体现自身英语水平的证明；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span><span>）专家推荐信两封，需有专家亲笔签字（模板见附件）；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span><span>）个人陈述（模版见附件）；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>5</span><span>）其他证明材料（可选），包括：获奖证书复印件；本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性成果等。</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>6</span><span>）个人展示照片</span></span><span><span>/</span><span>视频（可选）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>请准备以上材料电子版或扫描件（务必保证清晰可见），并按上述顺序整理</strong></span><span><strong>扫描后合成一个</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>PDF</strong></span><span><strong>文件</strong></span><span><strong>，命名为“</strong></span><span><strong>夏令营材料—报考专业</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span><span><strong>就读学校</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span><span><strong>姓名</strong></span><span><strong>”发送至邮箱</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>mater@nankai.edu.cn</strong></span><span><strong>，邮件题目为：</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>2025</strong></span><span><strong>南开材料夏令营</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span><span><strong>就读学校</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span><span><strong>姓名</strong></span><span><strong>。</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>报名时间</span></span></p><p><span>即日起至</span><span><span>07</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>09</span><span>日周三中午</span></span><span><span>12</span><span>：</span></span><span><span>00</span><span>之前。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>选拔营员和确认参营</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/2025/0703/c9297a574880/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>我院将组织专家审核组对报名材料进行审核和筛选，并于</span><span><span><span>2025</span></span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>07</span></span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>09</span></span><span>日</span><span>在学院网站发布入营名单，入营的同学请及时加入飞书群，未按时加入飞书群的同学视为放弃本次夏令营活动（届时通知）。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>三、活动安排</strong></span></p><p><span>夏令营活动时间：</span><span><span>07</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>14</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>-15</span><span>日（</span></span><span><span>07</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>14</span><span>日上午</span></span><span><span>9</span><span>点</span><span>～</span></span><span><span>11:30</span><span>入营报到）</span></span></p><p><span>夏令营期间拟开展学科介绍、参观交流、营员个人展示等活动，具体日程安排另行通知。</span></p><p><span><strong>四、营员待遇</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span></span><span>为全体营员准备早午晚餐券。</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span></span><span>为全体营员准备营员服。</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span></span><span>为全体营员购买夏令营活动期间的意外保险。</span></p><p><span>营员报到后需要全程参加活动，擅自离营者，将取消营员资格。</span></p><p><span><strong>四、联系方式</strong></span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>022-23502604</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>mater@nankai.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>以上内容如有变动，以最新通知为准。夏令营行程安排在入营名单公布后再行发布。</span></p><p><span>请随时关注学院招生主页：</span><span>https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/9297/list.htm </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/71/69/2c2acbcd4739ab8c9d9638252ca4/b5f326e6-2bc2-4e7f-b33c-1e974b3631fa.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">模板：个人陈述.docx</a> </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/71/69/2c2acbcd4739ab8c9d9638252ca4/58bb7c9e-83c5-4649-afac-82d287252628.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">模板：专家推荐函.docx</a></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"e62ac279a92355f55701e76d7aa6aab6ef99a94beae25e360eb4f6e6378fa4dd","textLength":1378,"sourceSha256":"cbfd38ce9a9bcac8f2bdd196ca0aec015b518e1abbd602a0551dc2afecc43cc3","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3c2919e0eeeca83a8ab4","title":"2025年南开大学材料科学与工程学院2025年魅力材料优秀大学生夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:25.395135+00:00"}
